+#### `meeting_summary_artifacts` and `meeting_summary_versions`
+
+`meeting_summary_artifacts` is the meeting-owned review pointer: `id UUID PK`,
+`tenant_id TEXT`, `access_conversation_id UUID`, `source_meeting_id TEXT`,
