+### Exact runtime codecs
+
+`@product-suite/contracts` exposes dependency-free strict decoders. Unknown keys,
+null in optional fields, non-finite numbers, malformed UUID/date/hash values,
+more than three suggestions/choices, duplicate positions, and over-length text
+fail closed.
+
+```ts
