+## Stop conditions
+
+Stop and return to PLAN review if implementation needs any of:
+
+- an unmerged/changed PR A contract or a second migration owner;
+- provider/email/label/equality authority or tenant-only meeting access;
+- a wildcard public row projection or client-selected authority/provenance;
+- automatic Product-Suite work, a write from Adjust/Dismiss/refresh, or normal Add
+  declassification;
+- more than three suggestions/choices, hidden applied fields, fabricated defaults,
+  unversioned mutation, mutable version/suggestion rows, or permissive stale handling;
+- generic agent mutation tools in Adjust, raw transcript/search work, content logs,
+  skipped real-DB evidence, weakened tests, or an oversized layer beyond the plan's
+  review bounds.
